{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A roguelike puzzle adventure where you use random tools to tackle levels any way you can imagine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level can be completed in almost infinite ways and every tool and level element can interact with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See that gap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6b935713cfa66044d799e5597e875504.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6b935713cfa66044d799e5597e875504.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6b935713cfa66044d799e5597e875504.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have a <strong>hookshot</strong> it's easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/8e4127940fc84ee18b6bbaf9b3908a36.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/8e4127940fc84ee18b6bbaf9b3908a36.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/8e4127940fc84ee18b6bbaf9b3908a36.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or maybe you have a <strong>speed pad</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/328eb46f68d3063f5911f823600783a1.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/328eb46f68d3063f5911f823600783a1.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/328eb46f68d3063f5911f823600783a1.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or perhaps you can <strong>make a platform movable</strong> and jump on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/28f9e265afe4b870ed1964f68b381c7b.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/28f9e265afe4b870ed1964f68b381c7b.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/28f9e265afe4b870ed1964f68b381c7b.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or build a bridge with <strong>glue and crates</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/43f8d2e4e1ef233f18c7876f3beb67f8.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/43f8d2e4e1ef233f18c7876f3beb67f8.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/43f8d2e4e1ef233f18c7876f3beb67f8.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On every run you will unlock, buy and find new tools to use in that run. Everything works with everything: <strong>find YOUR creative solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/theStory.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 20XX, a massive asteroid hurtles toward Earth\u2014only to stop, hovering above the planet. Within its core lies a wealth of rare materials, sparking a global mining operation that has been extracting resources for 25 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You play as Gustav, a seasoned worker selected for a high-stakes mission</strong>. A strange signal emanates from deep within the asteroid, and a team is sent to investigate. But as you descend into the heart of the asteroid, reality begins to warp. Time and space bend, and your team vanishes, leaving you alone. With no way to return, your only option is to push forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you reach the core and uncover the mystery of the asteroid, or be lost forever in its depths?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/Narrative_Scene.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/features.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong>: Each run is unique, challenging you to adapt your strategy. Will you rush for the exit, or take the time to gather powerful tools to tackle tougher levels?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ handmade levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ tools</strong> to interact with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>???+ narrative vignettes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/Map_Scene.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3223370?t=1753084138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/ed9873edb65cf9e457d67ad0a85725a1b172dbd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753084138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/ed2cfed39c30ac892dbe7285ff3fe14c7c9fa385/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753084138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/ed2cfed39c30ac892dbe7285ff3fe14c7c9fa385/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753084138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A roguelike puzzle adventure where you use random tools to tackle levels any way you can imagine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level can be completed in almost infinite ways and every tool and level element can interact with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See that gap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6b935713cfa66044d799e5597e875504.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6b935713cfa66044d799e5597e875504.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6b935713cfa66044d799e5597e875504.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have a <strong>hookshot</strong> it's easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/8e4127940fc84ee18b6bbaf9b3908a36.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/8e4127940fc84ee18b6bbaf9b3908a36.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/8e4127940fc84ee18b6bbaf9b3908a36.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or maybe you have a <strong>speed pad</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/328eb46f68d3063f5911f823600783a1.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/328eb46f68d3063f5911f823600783a1.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/328eb46f68d3063f5911f823600783a1.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or perhaps you can <strong>make a platform movable</strong> and jump on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/28f9e265afe4b870ed1964f68b381c7b.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/28f9e265afe4b870ed1964f68b381c7b.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/28f9e265afe4b870ed1964f68b381c7b.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or build a bridge with <strong>glue and crates</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/43f8d2e4e1ef233f18c7876f3beb67f8.poster.avif?t=1753084138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/43f8d2e4e1ef233f18c7876f3beb67f8.webm?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/43f8d2e4e1ef233f18c7876f3beb67f8.mp4?t=1753084138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On every run you will unlock, buy and find new tools to use in that run. Everything works with everything: <strong>find YOUR creative solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/theStory.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 20XX, a massive asteroid hurtles toward Earth\u2014only to stop, hovering above the planet. Within its core lies a wealth of rare materials, sparking a global mining operation that has been extracting resources for 25 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You play as Gustav, a seasoned worker selected for a high-stakes mission</strong>. A strange signal emanates from deep within the asteroid, and a team is sent to investigate. But as you descend into the heart of the asteroid, reality begins to warp. Time and space bend, and your team vanishes, leaving you alone. With no way to return, your only option is to push forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you reach the core and uncover the mystery of the asteroid, or be lost forever in its depths?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/Narrative_Scene.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/features.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong>: Each run is unique, challenging you to adapt your strategy. Will you rush for the exit, or take the time to gather powerful tools to tackle tougher levels?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ handmade levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ tools</strong> to interact with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>???+ narrative vignettes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/Map_Scene.png?t=1753084138\" /></div></p>","developers":["Palomar Games AB"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/4d911ae9ca5f6f8b99a3c6280fea328c808320e2/header.jpg?t=1753084138","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min